# Copy to `.env.development.local` (gitignored) to have the admin sign-in form
# open already filled in on `bun run dev`.
#
# Vite loads `.env.development.*` only in development mode, and the code that
# reads these (src/client/lib/dev-signin.ts) is additionally behind
# `import.meta.env.DEV` — which is the literal `false` in every build. So a
# production bundle contains neither the values nor the branch that reads them.
#
# Use the local test admin from `.dev.vars.example` / CLAUDE.md:
VITE_DEV_EMAIL=admin@example.com
VITE_DEV_PASSWORD=correct-horse-battery
